<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.188 points off FTSE June 23.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.188 points off FTSE June 23.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday and analysts estimate this will take 1.188 points off the index at the start of trading on June 23.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND     INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	EFFECT</p>
<p>	   COMPANY				 Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p> * British Steel			7.00   8.750    1.041</p>
<p> * Burton Group		     1.40   1.750    0.147</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
